  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"745\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\" height=\"256\" rowspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"115\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"90\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/l_bar_logo_2.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_history/\"><span class=\"forg-missing\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.uospace.net:80/skill/images/left_menu/n_history.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" style=\"width:110px;height:20px;line-height:20px\">울티마의역사</span></a></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_i/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/n_i.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_make/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/n_m.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_l/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/n_l.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_faq/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/n_faq.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_f/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/n_f.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_m/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><span class=\"forg-missing\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.uospace.net:80/skill/images/left_menu/n_ma.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" style=\"width:110px;height:20px;line-height:20px\">Britannian예의범절</span></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_meet/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/n_meet.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_j/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/n_j.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_s/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><span class=\"forg-missing\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.uospace.net:80/skill/images/left_menu/n_app.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" style=\"width:110px;height:20px;line-height:20px\">지원Staff 만나기</span></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"5\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/n_line.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"20\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;For Newbie</b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"39\" width=\"630\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"550\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F0F0F4\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"30\" width=\"546\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>Tutorial \n                Mode</b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"546\"> <p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">튜토리얼은 울티마 온라인을 처음 접해본 초보분을 위하여 </font></span>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">간단한 조작방법을 익히는 \n곳입니다. <br></font></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F0F0F4\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"30\" width=\"546\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;(1) 처음 튜토리얼로 접속하면 아래와 같은 창이나옵니다.</b></font></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"546\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020206185856/http://forg.co.kr/skill/images/newbie_1.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;</b></font></a>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020206185856/http://forg.uospace.net:80/skill/newbie_1.html\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"187\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/tu01_1.gif\" width=\"250\"></b></font></a><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020206185856/http://forg.uospace.net:80/skill/newbie_2.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"187\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/tu02_1.gif\" width=\"250\"></a></font></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">그럼 설명을 읽어보고 발자국을 \n따라가세요.</font></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F0F0F4\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"30\" width=\"546\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;(2) 간단한 명령어를 배울수 있습니다. </b></font></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"246\"> <p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020206185856/http://forg.uospace.net:80/skill/newbie_3.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"186\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/tu04_2.gif\" width=\"250\"></a></font></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"298\"> <p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">1.물건 사기(Vendor \n                    Buy):엔피씨에게 물건을 살 때</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">2.물건 팔기(Vendor Sell):엔피씨에게 물건을 팔 \n                            때<br></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">■주의 : 명령어는 띄어쓰기에 맞춰서 </font></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">원하는 명령어만 쳐야 \n합니다. <br></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">다른글과 섞이면 명령어가 안됩니다.</font></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F0F0F4\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"30\" width=\"546\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\"><b>&nbsp;</b></font><b><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">(3) 몬스터를 사냥하는 법을 배울수 \n있습니다.</font></span></b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"246\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020206185856/http://forg.uospace.net:80/skill/newbie_4.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"187\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/tu04_1.gif\" width=\"250\"></a></font></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"298\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">캐릭창의 PEACE를 누르면 전투모드가 되죠.</font></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">(Tab키를 \n                    누르셔도 전투모드가 됩니다)</font></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F0F0F4\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"30\" width=\"546\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\"><b>&nbsp;</b></font><b><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">(4) 모두 끝나면 마지막 문게이트를 나가면 \n헤이븐(영캐릭을 위한 도시)에 나옵니다</font></span></b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"544\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><img border=\"1\" height=\"400\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/tu05_1.gif\" width=\"300\"><img border=\"1\" height=\"400\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/tu05_2.gif\" width=\"240\"></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>1 번 사진</b></font><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> : 헤븐에선 영캐릭이 할수있는 여러가지 가능성을 알려줍니다. <br>광부, 전사, 트레져헌터 등 자신이 할수 있는것들을 쉽게 연습이 가능하죠. \n<br>다만 영캐릭은 항상 있는 편이 아니라서 헤븐엔 사람이 적은편이에요. </font>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>2 번 사진</b></font><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> : 튜토리얼 종료입구사진</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"30\" width=\"544\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><b><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;(5) 다른 \n                            마을로 가는 문게이트</font></span></b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"544\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">만약 다른 도시로 가길 원하신다면 아래의 지도를 따라가세요.</font>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">길찾기가 매우 힘든편이죠. <br>지도를 보고 잘 찾으셔야 해요. </font>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"1\" height=\"300\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/tu05_3.gif\" width=\"400\"><br>파란 문게이트를 \n통과하면 원하는 마을로 갈수 있습니다. <br>울온에 대하여 전혀 모르시는분은 왼쪽 첫 번째(Britain)을 <br>선택하시면 많은 사용자를 \n만날수 있게됩니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">그럼 여러분 즐거운 브리타니아 여행이 되시길 ^^*</font></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;Written \n                By Kalli</b></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"20\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/b_logo.gif\" width=\"100\">&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"></p>"
}
